          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekirooto kya Nebukadeneeza ekyakabiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Nebbukadaneeza, akatweka obukwenda bunu habantu ab'amahanga goona, ab'enganda zoona, kandi ab'endimi zoona ez'omunsi, naagamba ati: Nimbagondeza obusinge oburukukirra hara obu mubaire nabwo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikampikirra kumanyisa ebyamahano kandi ebihuniriza, Ruhanga Rutakirwa ebi yankoliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'okurorraho bye kabikuru n'ebyamahano bye ka byamaani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe Nebbukadaneeza, nkaba ndi kurungi omunju yange, ngwagwaine omu kikaali kyange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nkagenda naroota ekirooto, kyantiinisa muno; obu nkaba mbyamire omu kitabu kyange, ebiteekerezo byanyijaga omu mutwe, n'ebintu ebi nayolekerwe, byantiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kuturukya ekiragiro ninnyeta abanyamagezi boona aba Babbulooni, baije bansoborre amakuru g'ekirooto eki naroosire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaija abakozi b'ebyamasano, abafumu, Abakaludaaya n'abaraguzi; nabarootorra eki naroosire, baitu batasobole kunsoborra amakuru gaakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma haija Daneeri ogu ayayetwaga Beliteezasa, ibara ery'embandwa wange, kandi anyakurumu omwoyo ogw'embandwa abarukwera na uwe namugambira eki naroosire nti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bairaba Beriteesaza, iwe omukozi w'ebyamasano omukuru habw'okuba mmanyire nkooku oina omwoyo ogw'embandwa abarukwera, kandi okenga ensita zoona nikyo ndukukugambirra ekirooto eki naroosire; onsoborre amakuru gakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwe gwange ebi gwanyolekere mbyamire omu kitabu kyange, nibyo binu: obu nkaba ngwijagiire, nkarora omuti ogukaba guli hagati y'ensi nagwetegereza; gukaba guraihire muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuti ogu, gukagenda nigukura gwaraiha gwarumira kimu omwiguru, gwarorwa abakaba bali ha mpero y'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukaba gwina ebikoora ebirungi muno kandi gukaba gwanire muno, nugwo gwaliisaaga abantu boona. Enyamaiswa ez'omu kisaka, zaahuumuraga omu kiituuru kyagwo, enyonyi ez'omu mwanya zaaraaraga omu mataagi gagwo kandi, nugwo gwaliisaaga ebyomeezi byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obu nkaba mbyamire omu kitabu kyange, omuli ebi omutwe gwange ebi gwanyolekere, nkarora omulinzi, omulinzi arukwera, naasirimuka naaruga omwiguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabaliza haiguru naagamba ati: ‘Omuti ogu guteme, ogunogorreho amataagi gaagwo, ogunogeho ebibabi byagwo kandi orarangye ebijuma byagwo, binga enyamaiswa ziruge hansi yagwo, n'enyonyi ziruge omu mataagi gagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekikoro eky'emihama yagwo, okireke omwitaka, kiboherwe omweko ogw'ekyoma n'omulinga, kiri omu bunyansi obw'omu kisaka oburukworoba. Ojubye omuntu ogu n'orume orw'omwiguru; atungege omugabo hamu nenyamaiswa ez'omu kisaka; omuhindule omwiheho omutima ogw'omuntu, omuhe ogw'ekisoro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amale emyaka musanju ataina mutima gw'omuntu, baitu aina ogw'ekisoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Encwamu enu erugire ha kiragiro ky'abalinzi, yagumibwa ekigambo ky'abarukwera, hoona hoona, abantu bamanye Ruhanga nuwe alema obukama bw'abantu, nuwe abuha ou agondeze, kandi ataho omuntu owa rukugaywa mali nuwe aburolerre.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Nebbukadaneeza akagamba ati: Kinu nikyo ekirooto naroosire, hati iwe Beriteesaza, onsoborre amakuru gakyo, habwokuba abanyamagezi boona ab'omu bukama bwange, balemerwe, baitu iwe wenka, niwe orukusobora, habwokuba oina omwoyo ogw'embandwa ezirukwera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daneeri, kandi anyakwetwa Beriteesaza obu yahuliire eki, yatiina, yaburwa n'eky'okugamba. Omukama yagamba ati: “Beriteesaza, ekirooto rundi okusoborra amakuru gakyo, bireke kukutiinisa.” Beriteesaza yagarukamu ati: “Agutamba, ekirooto nikikahikeho abo abanyakukunoba, kandi amakuru gaakyo nigakahiheho abanyanzigwa baawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuti ogu warozire, ogwakuzire gwanyeeta muno, amasonsolya gagwo gaahika haiguru, ogwarozirwe aba hampero y'ensi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogukaba gwina amababi amarungi mali kandi gwanire muno, ogwalisaaga abantu boona; ogw'ekituuru ekyahuumurwamuga enyamaiswa ez'omu kisaka kandi ogw'amataagi agaaraarwamuga enyonyi ez'omu mwanya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niiwe nzaire ayakuzire waba w'amaani. Ekitiinisa kyawe kikeeyongera kyahika haiguru kandi obulemi bwawe bwahika ha mpero y'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agutamba, noobu oliba waboine omulinzi, arukwera naasisimuka naaruga omwiguru, yagamba ati: ‘Tema omuti ogu ogucebacebe, baitu ekikoro kyagwo eky'emihama okireke omwitaka, kiboherwe omweko ogw'ekyoma n'omulinga, omu bunyansi obw'ejubwa obw'omu kisaka; kandi omulinzi ogu omujubye n'orume orw'omwiguru; kandi atunge omugabo n'ebisoro eby'omu kisaka, okumara emyaka musanju’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamara, amakuru g'ekirooto eki nugo ganu: Eki kiragiro kya Ruhanga, amanyisize ekirikuhikaho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikigamba kiti: olibingwa omu bantu kandi oraikaraga n'enyamaiswa ez'omu iswa; olihambirizibwa kulya obunyansi nk'ente, kandi olimara emyaka musanju nootoonyerwa orume orw'omwiguru, okuhika obu olikamanya Ruhanga Rutakirwa nkooku nuwe alema obukama bw'abantu, kandi nkooku abuha ou agondeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiragiro ekirukugamba ngu: oleke ekikoro eky'emihama y'omuti, eki nikimanyisa ngu, obukama bwaawe nibwija kukulindirwa, okuhika obu olimanya Ruhanga nkooku nuwe alema ensi yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
