          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona bikahikaho omukama Nebbukadaneeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu haahingwireho ameezi ikumi n'abiri, akaba naarubatarubata eruguru y'ekikaali ekya Babbulooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yagamba ati: “Enu tiniyo Babbulooni ey'ekitiinisa ei nayombekeseze amaani n'obusobozi bwange ebe kaaruziika y'omukama, habw'ekitiinisa kyange?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama obwakaba nakyagamba ebigambo ebi, haahulirwa iraka niriruga omwiguru lyagamba liti: “Iwe omukama Nebbukadaneeza, otege amatu ohurre ebi ndukukugambira: obukama bukurugireho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noija kubingwa omu bantu oikale n'ebisoro eby'omu iswa; noija kuhambirizibwa kulya obunyansi nk'ente, okumara emyaka musanju, okuhika obu olikamanya Ruhanga nkooku nuwe alema obukama bw'abantu, kandi nkooku abuha ou agondeze.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo ekyagambiirwe Nebbukadaneeza, kikahikirra bwango. Akabingwa omu bantu, yatandika kulya obunyansi nk'ente, yaikaraga naatonyerwa orume orwarugaga omwiguru, okuhika isoke rye obu lyakuzire lyaingana ebyoya by'isamba, enono ze zaingana nk'ez'enyonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebbukaddaneeza naasiima Ruhanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
